Package: svent-bspwm
Version: 0.6.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>
Installed-Size: 6563
Depends: bspwm, sxhkd, polybar, rofi, kitty, dunst, python3, zsh, libnotify-bin, fonts-jetbrains-mono, pulseaudio-utils, iproute2, svent-core, svent-artwork, picom, feh, xclip, x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, network-manager
Recommends: flameshot, playerctl, brightnessctl, pavucontrol, i3lock, zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, bat, imagemagick
Suggests: betterlockscreen
Conflicts: sv-bspwm
Replaces: sv-bspwm
Provides: sv-bspwm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: Svent OS bspwm session defaults
 Default bspwm session for Svent OS: window manager rules, sxhkd keybindings,
 a Polybar bar with status scripts, Dunst notifications, Picom compositor, a
 Kitty terminal using zsh, and Rofi menus. Bundled fonts are registered with
 fontconfig and the defaults are deployed to root and existing users on install.
